What was copied
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Sixteen icons. The path, polyline, polygon, line and circle geometry of each was taken
unchanged from the Feather file named beside it. What we changed is the packaging and
nothing else: the shared attributes (`viewBox`, `fill`, `stroke`, `stroke-width`, the
round caps and joins) are set once on the `<svg>` element by the `Icon` component instead
of being repeated per file, `width` and `height` are a prop rather than a fixed 24, and
each icon is addressed by the name this application uses for the thing it stands for
rather than by Feather's name for the shape.

| our name     | Feather file     | origin  |
|--------------|------------------|---------|
| `project`    | `folder`         | Feather |
| `document`   | `file-text`      | Feather |
| `version`    | `layers`         | Feather |
| `run`        | `play-circle`    | Feather |
| `finding`    | `flag`           | Feather |
| `review`     | `search`         | Feather |
| `export`     | `download`       | Feather |
| `upload`     | `upload`         | Feather |
| `accept`     | `check`          | Feather |
| `reject`     | `x`              | Feather |
| `comment`    | `message-square` | Feather |
| `back`       | `arrow-left`     | Feather |
| `arrow`      | `arrow-right`    | Feather |
| `warning`    | `alert-triangle` | Feather |
| `error`      | `alert-circle`   | Feather |
| `success`    | `check-circle`   | Feather |
| `light`      | `sun`            | Feather |
| `dark`       | `moon`           | Feather |


